🔹 10. SKY130 Standard Cell Library

The optimized combinational logic can be mapped to standard cells from the SKY130 technology library.

Technology mapping converts the optimized logic into cells that are available in the target library.

Examples of standard cells include:

- AND gates
- OR gates
- Inverters
- Multiplexers
- Flip-flops

This allows the RTL design to be represented using real standard-cell implementations.

